<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Welcome to NovaGadget</title>
  </head>

  <body style="font-family: Arial; background: #f5f5f5; padding: 30px">
    <div
      style="
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: auto;
        background: white;
        padding: 30px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      "
    >
      <h2 style="color: #4f46e5">Welcome to NovaGadget 🎉</h2>

      <p>Hello <strong><%= fullName %></strong>,</p>

      <p>
        Thank you for creating an account with NovaGadget. We're excited to have
        you with us.
      </p>

      <p>
        You can now browse products, place orders, and enjoy a seamless shopping
        experience.
      </p>

      <hr />

      <p style="color: gray">
        Thanks,<br />
        NovaGadget Team
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
